  "fullDescription": "Add festive charm to your everyday accessories with this Christmas Character Keychain Set 3D STL. This adorable collection features four classic holiday characters: Santa Claus, a cheerful reindeer, a cute snowman, and a decorated Christmas tree.\n\nEach character includes an integrated hanging loop, making the models ideal for keyrings, bag charms, backpacks, zipper pulls, Christmas decorations, stocking stuffers, and handmade holiday gifts. The rounded shapes and detailed facial and seasonal elements create a fun, friendly Christmas aesthetic.\n\nFeatures\nSet of four Christmas character designs\nSanta Claus keychain\nReindeer keychain\nSnowman keychain\nChristmas tree keychain\nIntegrated hanging loops\nCute rounded character styling\nPerfect for keys, bags, backpacks, and zipper pulls\nGreat for Christmas gifts and holiday crafts\nSuitable for FDM and resin 3D printing\nColors can be customized using compatible 3D software\n\nPlease Note: This is a digital 3D model file. No physical product will be shipped. Please check your 3D printer and slicing software compatibility before printing. This 3D model is available only in STL color — if you’d like it colored, you’ll need to open the STL file in separate software to color it yourself.",
